; The default-projection e2e fixture (plans/33-default-projection.md).
;
; web/e2e/projectionDefault.e2e.ts runs against a SCRATCH COPY of this
; directory (target/e2e-projection-default/, staged fresh by
; web/playwright.config.ts), because the spec stars, un-stars and saves
; scenario files. Nothing here is ever written by a test.
;
; budget.journal is included, so the Projections tab can load it but never
; write it — and so it can never be the default (plan 33 D5). The two
; projection-*.journal files beside it are what the spec stars.

account assets:checking   ; type: C
account expenses:rent     ; type: X
account expenses:food     ; type: X
account revenues:salary   ; type: R
account equity:opening    ; type: E

include budget.journal

2026-06-01 opening balance
    assets:checking     $10000.00
    equity:opening

2026-06-05 rent
    expenses:rent        $1500.00
    assets:checking

2026-06-15 paycheck
    assets:checking      $4000.00
    revenues:salary
